<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">NEW ORDER</view><view class="title">下单</view><view class="subtitle">填好这些，就能安排取件。</view>
<view class="card"><view class="label">选择服务</view><picker range="{{services}}" range-key="name" value="{{serviceIndex}}" data-key="serviceIndex" bindchange="select"><view class="field">{{services[serviceIndex].name || '请选择服务'}} ⌄</view></picker><view class="label">物品说明</view><input class="field" placeholder="例如：两件外套、一双运动鞋" maxlength="200" value="{{items}}" data-key="items" bindinput="input"/><view class="label">备注（可选）</view><input class="field" placeholder="例如：周三下午在家" maxlength="200" value="{{note}}" data-key="note" bindinput="input"/></view>
<view class="card"><view class="label">取件园区</view><picker range="{{parks}}" value="{{parkIndex}}" data-key="parkIndex" bindchange="select"><view class="field">{{parks[parkIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker><view class="label">详细地址</view><input class="field" placeholder="楼栋 / 房间号，例如 3号楼502" maxlength="40" value="{{parkDetail}}" data-key="parkDetail" bindinput="input"/><view class="label">联系电话</view><input class="field" type="number" maxlength="11" value="{{contact}}" data-key="contact" bindinput="input"/></view>
<view class="card"><view class="label">物品照片（可选，最多 3 张）</view><view class="row thumbs"><image wx:for="{{media}}" wx:key="*this" class="thumb" src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removePhoto"/><view wx:if="{{media.length < 3}}" class="thumb add" bindtap="addPhoto">＋</view></view><view class="meta">点照片可删除。照片只在取件时核对用，不拍也不影响下单。</view></view>
<view class="card"><view class="label">怎么送到门店</view><view class="row"><view class="option {{delivery === 'self' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-value="self" bindtap="delivery">我自己送</view><view class="option {{delivery === 'runner' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-value="runner" bindtap="delivery">叫飞毛腿 · {{runnerFee / 100}} 元</view></view><view class="meta">选飞毛腿后，认证过的学生骑手会接单上门取件；送到门店这单就算跑完。</view></view>
<button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">提交订单</button><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载…</view></view>
